00:57:29.660 --> 00:57:31.490
So within, I disagree, I think I

00:57:33.920 --> 00:57:35.810
disagree with all of your points.

00:57:35.810 --> 00:57:39.172
So, in the spirit of [CROSSTALK] no, no,
no, but

00:57:39.172 --> 00:57:42.698
just to answer, I think that it's in a
