00:57:54.028 --> 00:57:57.190
&gt;&gt; Yes, right here.

00:57:57.190 --> 00:57:58.690
&gt;&gt; Hi my name is Alex, I'm a

00:57:58.690 --> 00:58:02.292
third year PhD student in engineering here
