00:58:02.292 --> 00:58:04.604
I have a question about the potential for

00:58:04.604 --> 00:58:08.412
crowd, crowd-source funding to inflame
violent groups and

00:58:08.412 --> 00:58:11.336
I, I had, thinking specifically about an
article

00:58:11.336 --> 00:58:14.900
I read recently concerning Syria which you
brought up.

00:58:14.900 --> 00:58:17.389
Which were certain very radical groups
that

00:58:17.389 --> 00:58:20.080
