00:58:46.080 --> 00:58:47.360
What do you think about this?

00:58:47.360 --> 00:58:51.190
&gt;&gt; That's a really excellent question and
we, we touch on this in, in the book.

00:58:51.190 --> 00:58:54.437
And I think I, I go back to, to Syria as
