00:59:02.130 --> 00:59:05.675
So Syria, in addition to fighting a
physical civil war, it's also

00:59:05.675 --> 00:59:09.365
fighting a cyber war which is being led by
the Syrian electronic army.

00:59:09.365 --> 00:59:11.489
What the Syrian electronic army has

00:59:11.489 --> 00:59:14.959
started doing is crowd-sourcing foreign
fighters, not

00:59:14.959 --> 00:59:19.291
with guns, but from the former Soviet
Union to come fight the cyber war.

00:59:19.291 --> 00:59:22.646
And it's interesting, there's about 15
thousand foreign fighters

00:59:22.646 --> 00:59:25.286
physically fighting in Syria, about a
third of them come

00:59:25.286 --> 00:59:27.651
from Europe, and about a third of those
from Europe

00:59:27.651 --> 00:59:30.419
are converts, which is sort of an
interesting data point.

00:59:30.419 --> 00:59:33.094
But, it's a totally, the serious, the
first example I

00:59:33.094 --> 00:59:35.881
can think of where you have software
engineers that are sort

00:59:35.881 --> 00:59:38.723
of added to the equation, fighting a
totally different type

00:59:38.723 --> 00:59:41.640
of war on top of the one that we're
familiar with.

00:59:41.640 --> 00:59:45.548
And if you think about Iraq for instance,
you know, obviously we're familiar

00:59:45.548 --> 00:59:50.030
with, ya know, sectarian violence that's
played out there and played out in Syria.

00:59:50.030 --> 00:59:53.228
When you think about sectarian violence
and then you think about something

00:59:53.228 --> 00:59:56.727
we're all familiar with, which is
cyber-bullying it's really the sort of

00:59:56.727 --> 00:59:57.944
the next stage of this, when

00:59:57.944 --> 01:00:00.632
cyber-bullying becomes better organized,
better funded,

01:00:00.632 --> 01:00:03.499
and in some cases state sponsored, which
gets to, to your point.

01:00:03.499 --> 01:00:06.298
You know, if one demographic or one
sector,

01:00:06.298 --> 01:00:09.910
one group is disproportionately able to
garner resources

01:00:09.910 --> 01:00:12.562
to terrorize a rival population both in
the

01:00:12.562 --> 01:00:16.339
physical world and also online, it's
doubly as damaging.

01:00:16.339 --> 01:00:21.907
I'm gonna we are gonna run out of time
