And so far, in the last year, pretty much
everything we talked

01:05:15.240 --> 01:05:18.249
about has occurred in one form or another,
although not necessarily by name.

01:05:19.530 --> 01:05:22.370
So, what I conclude is, we have roughly
the right architecture,

01:05:22.370 --> 01:05:25.790
but we now don't know exactly who the
players will be.

01:05:25.790 --> 01:05:30.670
And that will be a lot up to the people
who discuss this,

01:05:30.670 --> 01:05:35.530
the people who decide, who debate it, and
who understand the consequences of it.

01:05:35.530 --> 01:05:37.010
The issues around empowerment, both
leaking

01:05:37.010 --> 01:05:39.140
encryption, state actors, government and
so on

01:05:39.140 --> 01:05:43.310
and so forth, they're not going to go
away, these are new problems.

01:05:44.410 --> 01:05:48.940
And I would argue that and, and what's
nice about sort of finishing the book tour

01:05:48.940 --> 01:05:51.630
more or less here in California over the

01:05:51.630 --> 01:05:54.410
last year we're sort of this segment of
work.

01:05:54.410 --> 01:05:56.780
You guys can read and see what you think.

01:05:56.780 --> 01:06:01.380
Is that the people who grapple with these
issues it's now your turn.

01:06:03.340 --> 01:06:07.070
Government leaders, student leaders,
business leaders and so forth.

01:06:07.070 --> 01:06:10.910
To figure out what you're going to do into
this new digital age, right.

01:06:10.910 --> 01:06:13.780
And there will be huge wins.

01:06:13.780 --> 01:06:20.050
Huge empowerment, huge improvements ahead
of us if we do the right things.

01:06:20.050 --> 01:06:25.310
I still come back to my core bias which is
that I'm an optimist about people.

01:06:26.310 --> 01:06:30.900
And I think the empowerment bias that
Jarred described, it's such a great story.

01:06:32.010 --> 01:06:37.360
And I would never want society to somehow
stop that or slow it down.

01:06:37.360 --> 01:06:40.919
I think both of us have decided to spend
our lives working on this problem.

01:06:42.340 --> 01:06:47.916
And we're glad that you have because you
are both exemplars of trying to put ideas

01:06:47.916 --> 01:06:50.212
into action and I want to thank you

01:06:50.212 --> 01:06:53.990
very much for a wonderful conversation
this evening.

01:06:53.990 --> 01:06:57.230
And I want to encourage all of you, if you
have not, to

01:06:57.230 --> 01:07:01.982
buy the New Digital Age Reshaping the
Future of People Stations and Business.

01:07:01.982 --> 01:07:04.865
